---
---
<section class="community-ecosystem">
    <div class="community-grid">
        <!-- Community Hub -->
        <div class="ecosystem-card community">
            <p class="eyebrow">COPROCESSOR / HUB</p>
            <h2>The WE3 Community</h2>
            <p>A high-signal network of founders, engineers, and creatives who help stress-test ideas and provide specialized fractional expertise when needed.</p>
            <div class="builder-hub-preview">
                <span class="badge outline">BUILDER HUB</span>
                <p class="hub-note">Accessing our open-source tools & playbooks...</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Apprenticeship & Mentorship Gap -->
        <div class="ecosystem-card apprentices">
            <p class="eyebrow">PIPELINE / NEXT GEN</p>
            <h2>Bridging the Mentorship Gap</h2>
            <p>The industry lacks a formal path from "Junior" to "Elite". WE3 fills this void by embedding rising talent directly into our Core Triads.</p>
            <div class="mentorship-stat">
                <div class="stat-line">
                    <span class="label">SENIOR DEPTH</span>
                    <div class="bar-bg"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 100%;"></div></div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-line">
                    <span class="label">APPRENTICE VELOCITY</span>
                    <div class="bar-bg"><div class="bar-fill" style="width: 80%;"></div></div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p class="apprentice-note">They learn from the veterans; we gain fresh velocity; you get scalable elite execution.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .community-ecosystem {
        margin: var(--spacing-large) 0;
        padding-top: var(--spacing-large);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--ag-border);
    }
    .eyebrow {
        font-family: var(--typography-font-family-mono);
        color: var(--ag-accent);
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    }
    h2 { font-size: 2.2rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem; }
    
    .community-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: var(--spacing-large);
    }
    
    .ecosystem-card {
        padding: 2.5rem;
        background: var(--ag-surface);
        border: 1px solid var(--ag-border);
        border-radius: var(--effect-radius-large);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .builder-hub-preview {
        margin-top: auto;
        padding-top: 2rem;
        border-top: 1px dashed var(--ag-border);
    }
    .hub-note { font-family: var(--typography-font-family-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; opacity: 0.5; margin-top: 1rem; }

    .mentorship-stat {
        margin: 2rem 0;
        display: grid;
        gap: 1rem;
    }
    .stat-line { display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .stat-line .label { font-family: var(--typography-font-family-mono); font-size: 0.6rem; opacity: 0.7; }
    .bar-bg { height: 4px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ag-accent) 15%, transparent); border-radius: 2px; }
    .bar-fill { height: 100%; background: var(--ag-accent); border-radius: 2px; }

    .apprentice-note { font-style: italic; font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.8; }

    .badge {
        font-family: var(--typography-font-family-mono);
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        color: var(--ag-accent);
        border: 1px solid var(--ag-accent);
        padding: 2px 8px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        width: fit-content;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
        .community-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
</style>
